[node name="Help" type="Label" parent="HUD"]
anchors_preset = 1
anchor_left = 1.0
anchor_right = 1.0
offset_left = -700.0
offset_top = 10.0
offset_right = -12.0
offset_bottom = 120.0
grow_horizontal = 0
horizontal_alignment = 2
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.85)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 5
script = ExtResource("5_help")
text = "Left-drag the ground: move the city    Left-drag a person or taxi: pick up, flick to throw
Click: tap / knock on a wall    Double-click: fly there    Middle-drag: orbit    Wheel: zoom    Keys: WASD, Q/E, R/F    B: who is this (debug)    F1: debug panel
Hold LEFT still on the ground: miracle wheel (pick one, then click to cast it)    On a building: decrees and takeover marks    Right-drag a circle: water
The hand lifts people and things (not trees). Where you set a member down is what they do. A Rep at a door takes the building over and stays as its Manager; miracles help them."

